{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":79,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"A Psalm of Asaph","tok":[{"t":"A "},{"t":"Psalm","s":["H4210"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Asaph","s":["H0623"],"a":[1]}]},{"n":1,"text":"O God, the nations have come into Your inheritance; They have defiled Your holy temple; They have turned Jerusalem into heaps.","tok":[{"t":"O "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[0]},{"t":", the nations have "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[1]},{"t":" into Your "},{"t":"inheritance","s":["H5159"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; They have "},{"t":"defiled","s":["H2930"],"a":[4]},{"t":" Your "},{"t":"holy","s":["H6944"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"temple","s":["H1964"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; They have turned "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[10]},{"t":" into "},{"t":"heaps","s":["H5856"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"They have given the dead bodies of Your servants As food for the birds of heaven, The flesh of Your saints to the animals of the earth.","tok":[{"t":"They have "},{"t":"given","s":["H5414"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the dead "},{"t":"bodies","s":["H5038"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of Your "},{"t":"servants","s":["H5650"],"a":[3]},{"t":" As food for the birds of "},{"t":"heaven","s":["H8064"],"a":[6]},{"t":", The "},{"t":"flesh","s":["H1320"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of Your "},{"t":"saints","s":["H2623"],"a":[8]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"animals","s":["H2416"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"They have poured out their blood like water around Jerusalem, And there was no one to bury them.","tok":[{"t":"They have poured out their "},{"t":"blood","s":["H1818"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"like","s":["H8210"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"water","s":["H4325"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"around","s":["H5439"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[4]},{"t":", And there was no one to "},{"t":"bury","s":["H6912"],"a":[6]},{"t":" them."}]},{"n":4,"text":"We have become a reproach to our neighbors, A mocking and a derision to those around us.","tok":[{"t":"We have become a "},{"t":"reproach","s":["H2781"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to our neighbors, A mocking and a "},{"t":"derision","s":["H7047"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to those around us."}]},{"n":5,"text":"How long, O Jehovah? Will You be angry forever? Will Your jealousy burn like fire?","tok":[{"t":"How long, O "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":"? Will You be "},{"t":"angry","s":["H0599"],"a":[3]},{"t":" forever? Will Your "},{"t":"jealousy","s":["H7068"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"burn","s":["H1197"],"a":[5]},{"t":" like "},{"t":"fire","s":["H0784"],"a":[7]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":6,"text":"Pour out Your wrath upon the nations Who do not know You, And upon the kingdoms Who do not call upon Your name.","tok":[{"t":"Pour "},{"t":"out","s":["H8210"],"a":[0]},{"t":" Your "},{"t":"wrath","s":["H2534"],"a":[1]},{"t":" upon the nations Who do not know You, And upon the "},{"t":"kingdoms","s":["H4467"],"a":[8]},{"t":" Who do not "},{"t":"call","s":["H7121"],"a":[12]},{"t":" upon Your "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"For they have devoured Jacob And have desolated his habitation.","tok":[{"t":"For they have "},{"t":"devoured","s":["H0398"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jacob","s":["H3290"],"a":[3]},{"t":" And have desolated his habitation."}]},{"n":8,"text":"Do not remember against us the iniquities of our forefathers; May Your compassions quickly meet us, For we have been brought very low.","tok":[{"t":"Do not "},{"t":"remember","s":["H2142"],"a":[1]},{"t":" against us the "},{"t":"iniquities","s":["H5771"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of our forefathers; May Your compassions quickly meet us, For we have been "},{"t":"brought","s":["H1809"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"very","s":["H3966"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"low","s":["H1809"]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Help us, O God of our salvation, For the glory of Your name; And deliver us and expiate our sins, For Your name’s sake.","tok":[{"t":"Help","s":["H5826"],"a":[0]},{"t":" us, O "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of our "},{"t":"salvation","s":["H3468"],"a":[2]},{"t":", "},{"t":"For","s":["H1697"],"a":[4]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"glory","s":["H3519"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of Your "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; And "},{"t":"deliver","s":["H5337"],"a":[7]},{"t":" us and expiate our "},{"t":"sins","s":["H2403"],"a":[10]},{"t":", For Your "},{"t":"name’s","s":["H8034"],"a":[12]},{"t":" sake."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Why should the nations say, Where is their God? May the avenging of the blood of Your servants, which has been poured out, Be known among the nations in our sight.","tok":[{"t":"Why should the nations "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":", Where is their "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[4]},{"t":"? May the avenging of the "},{"t":"blood","s":["H1818"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of Your "},{"t":"servants","s":["H5650"],"a":[10]},{"t":", which has been poured out, Be "},{"t":"known","s":["H3045"],"a":[5]},{"t":" among the nations in our "},{"t":"sight","s":["H5869"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"May the sighing of the prisoner come before You. According to the greatness of Your power preserve those appointed to die,","tok":[{"t":"May the "},{"t":"sighing","s":["H0603"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"prisoner","s":["H0615"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[1]},{"t":" You. According to the "},{"t":"greatness","s":["H1433"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of Your "},{"t":"power","s":["H2220"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"preserve","s":["H3498"],"a":[6]},{"t":" those "},{"t":"appointed","s":["H1121"],"a":[7]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"die","s":["H8546"],"a":[8]},{"t":","}]},{"n":12,"text":"And render to our neighbors sevenfold into their bosom Their reproach, with which they have reproached You, O Lord.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"render","s":["H7725"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to our neighbors "},{"t":"sevenfold","s":["H7659"],"a":[2]},{"t":" into their "},{"t":"bosom","s":["H2436"],"a":[4]},{"t":" Their "},{"t":"reproach","s":["H2781"],"a":[5]},{"t":", with which they have "},{"t":"reproached","s":["H2778"],"a":[7]},{"t":" You, O "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":13,"text":"And we, Your people and the sheep of Your pasture, Will give You thanks forever; From generation to generation we will tell out Your praise.","tok":[{"t":"And we, Your "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"sheep","s":["H6629"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of Your "},{"t":"pasture","s":["H4830"],"a":[3]},{"t":", Will give You "},{"t":"thanks","s":["H3034"],"a":[4]},{"t":" forever; From generation to "},{"t":"generation","s":["H1755"],"a":[8]},{"t":" we will tell out Your "},{"t":"praise","s":["H8416"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]}]}
